ecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182820/extras/012658d8b85868d5b2380be3803912ff.mp4?t=1758468301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Navigate through deadly traps, fight off temple guards, and face an active volcano to uncover the truth behind ancient Aztec legends. But beware—the gods don't take kindly to intruders.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182820/extras/321cacf9d209443b52641d8ff33d5e5a.poster.avif?t=1758468301\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182820/extras/321cacf9d209443b52641d8ff33d5e5a.webm?t=1758468301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182820/extras/321cacf9d209443b52641d8ff33d5e5a.mp4?t=1758468301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support</strong> – Play your way with seamless controller integration, ensuring smooth and immersive gameplay on every platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In 1920s Mexico, married archaeologists Jon and Jess embark on a daring expedition to uncover a lost temple deep in the jungle, built for gods to live and worship in. At the base of a towering volcano, where they rendezvous with a second team—unaware of the dangers lurking ahead.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3182820/header.jpg?t=1758468301", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamsta